#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A brick oven bakes spiced gingerbread. The counter has room to cool and ice each tray."
msgstr "Um forno de tijolos assa pão de mel com especiarias. O balcão tem espaço para esfriar e confeitar cada assadeira."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A collection of carved reindeer, wrapped for the gift stall."
msgstr "Uma coleção de renas entalhadas, embrulhadas para a barraca de presentes."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A covered counter for the market's first stall."
msgstr "Um balcão coberto para a primeira barraca da feira."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A covered stall keeps the reindeer dry. The farrier has room to mend their harness and fit shoes."
msgstr "Uma baia coberta mantém as renas secas. O ferrador tem espaço para consertar os arreios e ajustar as ferraduras."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A fir heavy with fresh snow."
msgstr "Um abeto carregado de neve fresca."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A friendly snowman is saving you a seat."
msgstr "Um boneco de neve simpático está guardando um lugar para você."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A long sheltered counter gives shoppers room to wrap parcels and tie on tags."
msgstr "Um balcão comprido e abrigado dá espaço para embrulhar pacotes e amarrar etiquetas."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A mulled-wine counter at the market entrance gives arriving visitors a place to warm up."
msgstr "Um balcão de vinho quente na entrada da feira dá aos visitantes um lugar para se aquecer."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A seat for watching the snow fall."
msgstr "Um assento para ver a neve cair."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A stove at the kiosk keeps cocoa hot. It faces the lane so visitors can buy a cup on their way through."
msgstr "Um fogão no quiosque mantém o chocolate quente. Fica de frente para a alameda, para quem passa comprar uma xícara."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "A warm light with a wreath on its post."
msgstr "Uma luz acolhedora com uma guirlanda no poste."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "Baubles, a golden star and twinkling lights."
msgstr "Bolas de enfeite, uma estrela dourada e luzinhas piscando."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "Blocks cut from the frozen lake are shaped and stacked here before they thaw."
msgstr "Os blocos cortados do lago congelado são moldados e empilhados aqui antes de derreter."

