msgid "Snowy rocks"
msgstr "Pedras nevadas"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "Standing to attention all season."
msgstr "Em posição de sentido a temporada toda."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "Station kiosk"
msgstr "Quiosque da estação"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The covered carousel gives children a place to ride. Wind-up toys keep the queue busy."
msgstr "O carrossel coberto dá às crianças um lugar para brincar. Brinquedos de corda distraem a fila."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The furnace keeps glass hot enough to blow into thin, hollow baubles."
msgstr "O forno mantém o vidro quente o bastante para soprar bolas finas e ocas."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The rink kiosk lends skates and sharpens blades beside the ice."
msgstr "O quiosque da pista empresta patins e afia lâminas ao lado do gelo."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The roof sparkles with sugar-frosted fireworks."
msgstr "O telhado cintila com fogos cobertos de açúcar."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The shop pours candles and trims the wicks for the lanterns that light the market lanes."
msgstr "A loja derrete velas e apara os pavios das lanternas que iluminam as alamedas da feira."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The sleigh carries sacks of presents through snowy lanes where a cart would sink."
msgstr "O trenó leva sacos de presentes por ruas nevadas onde uma carroça afundaria."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The smokehouse cures lake trout over a slow fire, so the fish can keep through winter."
msgstr "O defumadouro cura trutas do lago em fogo brando, para o peixe durar o inverno todo."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The stall keeps fireworks dry and ready for the evening display over the square."
msgstr "A barraca mantém os fogos secos e prontos para o espetáculo da noite sobre a praça."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The station clock tells shoppers how long they have before the next train."
msgstr "O relógio da estação diz aos clientes quanto tempo falta para o próximo trem."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The tall fir anchors the market square. Its star can be seen from the far end of the lane."
msgstr "O abeto alto é o centro da praça da feira. Sua estrela se vê do outro lado da alameda."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The toy bench has room to cut, sand and paint wooden blocks and other small toys."
msgstr "A bancada de brinquedos tem espaço para cortar, lixar e pintar blocos de madeira e outros brinquedos pequenos."

#: games/christmas-market/lua/buildings.lua
msgid "The workshop saws pine for stalls and signboards. A roof keeps the bundled lumber dry."
msgstr "A serraria corta pinho para barracas e placas. Um telhado mantém a madeira empilhada seca."

